{"v":4,"catch":"踏上史詩之旅，取回傳說之劍。","desc":"Goblin Sword 是一個復古風格的動作平台遊戲，帶有少量rpg元素。\n\n邪惡巫師領導的怪物大軍入侵了你的家園。 \n在面對邪惡的巫師前，你可以盡量殺死怪物、取得戰利品、避開危險陷阱，和擊敗險惡的頭目。\n\n遊戲特色：\n-89 個關卡\n-13 個頭目\n-30 個擁有特殊攻擊力的武器\n-30 個能給予你能力的聖物\n-14 套服裝\n-8 個跟隨並幫助你的守護者\n-5 個秘密極難關卡\n-裝飾家居用的紀念品","publisher":"Gelato Games","release":"2020-05-21","genres":["動作","冒險","街機","角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","韓文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fa5c454dad12c87567c1dcaac1bbc763990a2c255284125c3ead05ea930d2c0d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/280f7556f430229d191663e00ee58bf5a26cd14ebea4a517e09999410799ad51.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/043851591086e36e34707cbf88ac4cc0b7bee4e57dce588a77bdf2a15bbba37a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/769f3ec8c5a80dcf2bd5d42fa3853e9a826397b645291fdec07b003d4baa1774.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dc00188c59304631513d6bf70e3719a13de724f8d462b3e590e7d4f4c0a66c46.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/03d1225a69dc37db5fda4fcd5bad544ea69ae436d59b32018024d119eaa34e90.jpg"],"titleId":"0100193011a4c000","dlc":[],"vids":["dfMFTFMjM0Q"]}